# Tile Forge authored demo.
# It paints with the mouse, exercises edit history and serialization, then
# enters the isolated playtest and solves the bundled tiny Sokoban map.

at 0 rtc 2026-08-12T15:10:05

# Explicitly select the wall brush and drag a short obstacle row.
at 0.7s key 2 down
at 0.8s key 2 up
at 1.0s move -102 112 during 0.8s
at 1.9s mouse 0 0 1
at 2.0s move 120 0 during 1s 1
at 3.1s mouse 0 0 0

# One drag is one history entry. Undo and redo restore the whole gesture.
at 3.5s key LCTRL down
at 3.6s key Z down
at 3.7s key Z up
at 3.8s key LCTRL up
at 4.1s key LCTRL down
at 4.2s key Y down
at 4.3s key Y up
at 4.4s key LCTRL up

# Save the validated editor map under build/tilemap_demo.mlmap.
at 4.7s key V down
at 4.8s key V up
at 5.0s key S down
at 5.1s key S up

# Enter play mode. Push down, undo that move, then solve deliberately.
at 5.5s key ENTER down
at 5.6s key ENTER up
at 6.0s key S down
at 6.1s key S up
at 6.3s key U down
at 6.4s key U up

at 6.7s key S down
at 6.8s key S up
at 7.0s key W down
at 7.1s key W up
at 7.3s key A down
at 7.4s key A up
at 7.6s key S down
at 7.7s key S up
at 7.9s key S down
at 8.0s key S up
at 8.2s key D down
at 8.3s key D up
at 8.5s key D down
at 8.6s key D up

at 9.2s key LGUI down
at 9.3s key W down
at 9.4s key W up
at 9.5s key LGUI up
